source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Apply exactly a sorting preview, rejecting changed mail or rules

Usage: mxr rules treatment-apply [OPTIONS] [RULE] [TOKEN]

Arguments:
  [RULE]
  [TOKEN]

Options:
      --form <FORM>                    The unchanged RuleFormData JSON file, or - for stdin
      --preview-token <PREVIEW_TOKEN>  Token from a draft preview (saved rules may pass it positionally)
  -h, --help                           Print help
